+Workspace and tab creation, and pane splitting, leave focus unchanged by default. `--focus` selects the new layout; `--no-focus` states the default explicitly. Without `--cwd`, new terminals follow the configured `terminal.new_cwd` policy, which follows the source pane or workspace by default; new workspaces use `terminal.new_workspace_cwd` instead when it is set. Each `--env KEY=VALUE` adds or replaces that variable in the new root shell.
 
 ## Panes
 
